<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka James Finlay H1 net up 58 pct. [CORRECTED 06:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka James Finlay H1 net up 58 pct. [CORRECTED 06:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects to make clear that result is for first six</p>
<p>months of the financial year, not the first quarter.)</p>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of rupes unless stated):</p>
<p>    Net profit	32.91   vs    20.81</p>
<p>    Turnover	 539.87   vs   474.77</p>
<p>    Tax		  8.63   vs     3.92</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited.</p>
<p>James Finlay &amp; Co (Colombo) Ltd which exports tea and manages plantations, is also in insurance, pest control, industrial and agro chemicals, travel and tourism.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
